      "order": 31,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "text": "W2 — LOCK + REFINE\n\nRequired custom nodes (install via ComfyUI Manager):\n  - ComfyUI_IPAdapter_plus  (by cubiq)\n  - comfyui_controlnet_aux  (by Fannovel16)\n\nPart A — Identity Lock Generation:\n  1. Set 'Character Reference' to your W1 winner image.\n  2. Set 'Pose Reference' to a 3d.sk photo or canonical shot.\n  3. Fix seed in Lock Generation Sampler for reproducibility.\n  4. Depth ControlNet is optional — bypass nodes 24-26 to save VRAM.\n  5. Output goes to locked/render.\n\nPart B — Regional Refinement (MUTED by default):\n  1. Unmute the 'Regional Inpaint' group to enable.\n  2. Set 'Base Render to Refine' to your Part A output image.\n  3. Set 'Region Mask' — white areas will be re-generated.\n  4. Adjust denoise (0.55 default) — higher = more change.\n  5. Uses same identity-locked MODEL for consistency.\n  6. Output goes to locked/refined."
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [800, 900],
      "size": {"0": 340, "1": 140},
      "flags": {},
      "order": 32,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "text": "IPAdapterFaceID weights:\n  weight (0.85) = face identity strength\n  weight_v2 (1.0) = global image influence\n  end_at (1.0) = active full denoising\n\nIf face fights the pose, try end_at=0.75"
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [1200, 900],
      "size": {"0": 340, "1": 120},
      "flags": {},
      "order": 33,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "text": "Body IP-Adapter:\n  weight (0.4) = body appearance nudge\n  end_at (0.75) = stop early, let pose win\n\n  Lower weight if pose is being ignored.\n  This node is optional — bypass to disable."
      }
    },

    {
