      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "text": "REGIONAL INPAINT GROUP (muted by default)\n\nTo use:\n  1. Right-click any node in this group → Set Mode → Active\n     (or select all nodes in group and set mode=0)\n  2. Set Base Render to your lock output image\n  3. Paint a white mask over the region to fix\n  4. The inpaint sampler uses the SAME identity-locked MODEL\n     so face/body consistency is preserved\n  5. Adjust denoise (0.3-0.7) based on how much change needed"
      }
    }
